},"favorite_count":13,"favorited":false,"full_text":"／\n令和８年度ガス保安功労者経済産業大臣表彰の受賞者が決定しました🎉\n＼\n経済産業省では、都市ガスの保安に係る関係者の意欲向上及び国民の理解促進を目的として「ガス保安功労者経済産業大臣表彰」を行っています。今年の受賞者は全部門で計23件となりました。\n詳細👉https://t.co/MTDLwUeFIG","id_str":"2118302376742576319","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":6,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"266566401"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[{"indices":[153,158],"text":"ガス安全"},{"indices":[159,162],"text":"表彰"}],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"meti.go.jp/press/2026/11/…","expanded_url":"https://www.meti.go.jp/press/2026/11/20261105001.html","indices":[129,152],"url":"https://t.co/yCv7SPPBTZ"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMTgzMDIzNzY2MzM0MzQxMTI=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"／\n令和８年度ガス保安功労者経済産業大臣表彰の受賞者が決定しました🎉\n＼\n経済産業省では、都市ガスの保安に係る関係者の意欲向上及び国民の理解促進を目的として「ガス保安功労者経済産業大臣表彰」を行っています。今年の受賞者は全部門で計23件となりました。\n詳細👉https://t.co/yCv7SPPBTZ\n#ガス安全 #表彰"}}},"rest_id":"2118302376742576319","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"7614","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2118302376742576319","sortIndex":"2118598293196898202"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"legacy":{"binding_values":[{"key":"photo_image_full_size_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":419,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2118301704710164480/45EYVncE?format=jpg&name=800x419","width":800},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image","value":{"image_value":{"height":147,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2118301704710164480/45EYVncE?format=jpg&name=280x150","width":280},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"description","value":{"string_value":"一年中使える再エネ「地中熱」を知っていますか？地下の温度は、年間を通じてほぼ一定。夏は外気より冷たく、冬は暖かいという特性を活かして、冷暖房などに利用できます。身近な場所でも活用が進む「地中熱」。その仕組みやメリット、導入事例をご紹介します！","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"domain","value":{"string_value":"www.enecho.meti.go.jp","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":314,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2118301704710164480/45EYVncE?format=jpg&name=600x600","width":600},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"summary_photo_image_small","value":{"image_value":{"height":202,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2118301704710164480/45EYVncE?format=jpg&name=386x202","width":386},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_original","value":{"image_value":{"height":741,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2118301704710164480/45EYVncE?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1416},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"photo_image_full_size_small","value":{"image_value":{"height":202,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2118301704710164480/45EYVncE?format=jpg&name=386x202","width":386},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"summary_photo_image_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":419,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2118301704710164480/45EYVncE?format=jpg&name=800x419","width":800},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_small","value":{"image_value":{"height":75,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2118301704710164480/45EYVncE?format=jpg&name=144x144","width":144},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_x_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":741,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2118301704710164480/45EYVncE?format=png&name=2048x2048_2_exp","width":1416},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"photo_image_full_size_original","value":{"image_value":{"height":741,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2118301704710164480/45EYVncE?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1416},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"vanity_url","value":{"scribe_key":"vanity_url","string_value":"enecho.meti.go.jp","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"photo_